WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,000
Is eyebrows treat the metastasis to bone cancer from the breast?

00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,120
Well, I can't really say eyebrows does or does not do anything, but if the eyebrows

00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:26,520
is effectively killing the cancer, it will, should effectively kill the cancer.

00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:32,200
That's metastasis anywhere in your body, because if you have metastasis to the bone, remember,

00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,800
it's still breast cancer, it's not bone cancer.

00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,800
It's still breast cancer.

00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:40,760
So if you have prostate cancer, the metastasis to the bone, it's not bone cancer.

00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,760
It's prostate cancer.

00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:44,800
So just keep that in mind and that will help you work through that.

